{
  "schema":"tm-fgo-extracted-dialogue-index-v1",
  "chapterId":"fgo-lb5-2-olympos",
  "sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script",
  "credibility":"B",
  "canonStatus":"canon-like",
  "coverage":{"quoteLinesObserved":41,"quoteRecords":41,"skipped":0},
  "dialogue":[
    {"dialogueId":"dlg-lb5-2-A-001","timelineId":"evt-lb5-2-A","speakerRaw":"宙斯","quoteRaw":"吾名为宙斯。大神宙斯是也。自神代延续至今的大洋，巨大的星间都市，吾乃统治这所有一切的，大西洋异闻带之王。","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-098-lb5-2-olympos.txt:28"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueId":"dlg-lb5-2-A1-001","timelineId":"evt-lb5-2-A1","speakerRaw":"宙斯","quoteRaw":"世上怎可能存在那般强大的芦苇啊。","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-098-lb5-2-olympos.txt:31"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueId":"dlg-lb5-2-A2-001","timelineId":"evt-lb5-2-A2","speakerRaw":"基尔什塔利亚","quoteRaw":"只祈祷他的心不会屈服吧。并要再次出现在我的面前———我必须要让他耗尽自己的全部力量后，迎来败北才行。","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-098-lb5-2-olympos.txt:34"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueId":"dlg-lb5-2-B1-001","timelineId":"evt-lb5-2-B1","speakerRaw":"欧罗巴神谕","quoteRaw":"宙斯说，杀了他们。","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-098-lb5-2-olympos.txt:37"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueId":"dlg-lb5-2-B1-002","timelineId":"evt-lb5-2-B1","speakerRaw":"福尔摩斯","quoteRaw":"生活在奥林波斯的所有人，都是我们的敌人。","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-098-lb5-2-olympos.txt:38"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueId":"dlg-lb5-2-B2-001","timelineId":"evt-lb5-2-B2","speakerRaw":"尼古拉·特斯拉","quoteRaw":"登陆奥林波斯的泛人类史英灵，已经全部被消灭了。","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-098-lb5-2-olympos.txt:41"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueId":"dlg-lb5-2-C1-001","timelineId":"evt-lb5-2-C1","speakerRaw":"希翁","quoteRaw":"掌握用来对抗机械构造之神的———最后希望。","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-098-lb5-2-olympos.txt:44"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueId":"dlg-lb5-2-C2-001","timelineId":"evt-lb5-2-C2","speakerRaw":"马卡里俄斯","quoteRaw":"我们也渴望与昨日不同的明日。","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-098-lb5-2-olympos.txt:47"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueId":"dlg-lb5-2-C2-002","timelineId":"evt-lb5-2-C2","speakerRaw":"阿黛勒","quoteRaw":"这一万年来，———我们一直在这里止步不前。","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-098-lb5-2-olympos.txt:48"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueId":"dlg-lb5-2-C3-001","timelineId":"evt-lb5-2-C3","speakerRaw":"宙斯","quoteRaw":"吾虽与泛人类史为敌，却并非与人类为敌的存在。","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-098-lb5-2-olympos.txt:51"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueId":"dlg-lb5-2-C3-002","timelineId":"evt-lb5-2-C3","speakerRaw":"得墨忒耳","quoteRaw":"接下来我将杀死你们一次。","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-098-lb5-2-olympos.txt:52"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueId":"dlg-lb5-2-C4-001","timelineId":"evt-lb5-2-C4","speakerRaw":"得墨忒耳","quoteRaw":"但愿无数奥林波斯百姓、我的孩子们、1000万民众能获得安宁。但愿他们不会受伤，不会痛苦。但愿，但愿他们能获得安详。","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-098-lb5-2-olympos.txt:55"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueId":"dlg-lb5-2-C4-002","timelineId":"evt-lb5-2-C4","speakerRaw":"戈尔德鲁夫","quoteRaw":"我最爱惜自己！最重视自己！正因如此！才不愿意成为人类的叛徒！才不想成为一个卑鄙小人！","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-098-lb5-2-olympos.txt:56"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueId":"dlg-lb5-2-D1-001","timelineId":"evt-lb5-2-D1","speakerRaw":"阿佛洛狄忒","quoteRaw":"我会管理他们，但不打算去爱他们。","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-098-lb5-2-olympos.txt:59"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueId":"dlg-lb5-2-D1-002","timelineId":"evt-lb5-2-D1","speakerRaw":"破神同盟AI","quoteRaw":"破神术式·冠位英灵指定召唤！这就是我们的王牌！","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-098-lb5-2-olympos.txt:60"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueId":"dlg-lb5-2-D2-001","timelineId":"evt-lb5-2-D2","speakerRaw":"武藏","quoteRaw":"如果能在承认恶是恶的前提下受伤，在坚信善是善的前提下背叛———那我决不会不由分说地杀死那个人。因为我会想了解那人的理由 and 心情。","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-098-lb5-2-olympos.txt:63"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueId":"dlg-lb5-2-D3-001","timelineId":"evt-lb5-2-D3","speakerRaw":"卡利古拉","quoteRaw":"余之女神狄安娜已被击坠。对吧。……是这样啊。俄里翁完成了自己的使命啊。那就无需哀叹。余之女神肯定已经前往应去之地。","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-098-lb5-2-olympos.txt:66"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueId":"dlg-lb5-2-D3_5-001","timelineId":"evt-lb5-2-D3_5","speakerRaw":"福尔摩斯","quoteRaw":"职阶Beast。你无疑是七个人类恶之一。","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-098-lb5-2-olympos.txt:69"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueId":"dlg-lb5-2-D3_5-002","timelineId":"evt-lb5-2-D3_5","speakerRaw":"高扬斯卡娅","quoteRaw":"还是继续叫我高扬斯卡娅吧，名侦探。毕竟我根本没有真名那种无聊的玩意儿。","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-098-lb5-2-olympos.txt:70"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueId":"dlg-lb5-2-D4-001","timelineId":"evt-lb5-2-D4","speakerRaw":"阿佛洛狄忒","quoteRaw":"只要人类还有可以思考的知性，就无法敌过神明。","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-098-lb5-2-olympos.txt:73"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueId":"dlg-lb5-2-D4-002","timelineId":"evt-lb5-2-D4","speakerRaw":"卡利古拉","quoteRaw":"不可屈膝跪地！你的存在方式令余感到耀眼。盾之少女，玛修·基列莱特。","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-098-lb5-2-olympos.txt:74"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueId":"dlg-lb5-2-D5-001","timelineId":"evt-lb5-2-D5","speakerRaw":"阿佛洛狄忒","quoteRaw":"赫淮斯托斯……我……我……","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-098-lb5-2-olympos.txt:77"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueId":"dlg-lb5-2-D5-002","timelineId":"evt-lb5-2-D5","speakerRaw":"欧罗巴","quoteRaw":"其实我很残酷。肯定比这里的任何人，都要残酷。","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-098-lb5-2-olympos.txt:78"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueId":"dlg-lb5-2-E1-001","timelineId":"evt-lb5-2-E1","speakerRaw":"马卡里俄斯","quoteRaw":"决不能做出错误的判断。比起我的复仇，实现破神作战更为重要。","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-098-lb5-2-olympos.txt:81"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueId":"dlg-lb5-2-E1-002","timelineId":"evt-lb5-2-E1","speakerRaw":"佩佩隆奇诺","quoteRaw":"就是你们翘首以盼的『大召唤器』哦。据说是快要完成了，所以让你们去拿。","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-098-lb5-2-olympos.txt:82"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueId":"dlg-lb5-2-E2-001","timelineId":"evt-lb5-2-E2","speakerRaw":"欧罗巴","quoteRaw":"我是欧罗巴。既是统治星间都市山脉奥林波斯的宙斯神的巫女兼神妃。也是———破神同盟的『协助者』。","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-098-lb5-2-olympos.txt:85"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueId":"dlg-lb5-2-E3-001","timelineId":"evt-lb5-2-E3","speakerRaw":"欧罗巴","quoteRaw":"将他们拴在身边横亘约一万年之久……这种事……是不可……原谅的……！","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-098-lb5-2-olympos.txt:88"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueId":"dlg-lb5-2-E3-002","timelineId":"evt-lb5-2-E3","speakerRaw":"普罗米修斯·赫淮斯托斯","quoteRaw":"哪怕失去所有合神对象……他依然是最大最强的神。","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-098-lb5-2-olympos.txt:89"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueId":"dlg-lb5-2-E4-001","timelineId":"evt-lb5-2-E4","speakerRaw":"阿黛勒","quoteRaw":"即便如此……我们也不再需要永恒的今天。","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-098-lb5-2-olympos.txt:92"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueId":"dlg-lb5-2-E4-002","timelineId":"evt-lb5-2-E4","speakerRaw":"马卡里俄斯","quoteRaw":"哪怕等待我们的将是灭亡，我们依然渴望着明天。","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-098-lb5-2-olympos.txt:93"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueId":"dlg-lb5-2-F1-001","timelineId":"evt-lb5-2-F1","speakerRaw":"卡多克","quoteRaw":"空想树是在地球白纸化之后才出现的。这个顺序非常重要。","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-098-lb5-2-olympos.txt:96"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueId":"dlg-lb5-2-F2-001","timelineId":"evt-lb5-2-F2","speakerRaw":"凯妮斯","quoteRaw":"我现在状态好得不能再好了！不错，就这样一口气冲到宙斯面前吧！","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-098-lb5-2-olympos.txt:99"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueId":"dlg-lb5-2-F3-001","timelineId":"evt-lb5-2-F3","speakerRaw":"佩佩隆奇诺","quoteRaw":"我觉得如果是你，不，唯有你才可以打败他。","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-098-lb5-2-olympos.txt:102"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueId":"dlg-lb5-2-F4-001","timelineId":"evt-lb5-2-F4","speakerRaw":"罗穆路斯·奎里努斯","quoteRaw":"辛苦你们奋战至今。从现在起，有我在这里。———来吧，出征。一同去拯救世界吧。","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-098-lb5-2-olympos.txt:105"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueId":"dlg-lb5-2-G-001","timelineId":"evt-lb5-2-G","speakerRaw":"武藏","quoteRaw":"永别了，咕哒。别说做不做得到了……我根本连想都没想过。———你，一定要夺回自己的世界哦。","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-098-lb5-2-olympos.txt:108"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueId":"dlg-lb5-2-H-001","timelineId":"evt-lb5-2-H","speakerRaw":"基尔什塔利亚","quoteRaw":"不会像以往那样，创造出拯救人类的神明。而是每一个人，都能成为拯救他人的神。","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-098-lb5-2-olympos.txt:111"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueId":"dlg-lb5-2-I-001","timelineId":"evt-lb5-2-I","speakerRaw":"基尔什塔利亚","quoteRaw":"哪怕『异星之神』已经降临。哪怕你们现在只能逃跑。但只要能活下去，你们就赢了。你们还有逆转的机会。因为你们还没有输啊。","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-098-lb5-2-olympos.txt:114"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueId":"dlg-lb5-2-J-001","timelineId":"evt-lb5-2-J","speakerRaw":"基尔什塔利亚","quoteRaw":"若能如愿，我真想与A组的大家一起拯救世界啊。","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-098-lb5-2-olympos.txt:117"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueId":"dlg-lb5-2-K-001","timelineId":"evt-lb5-2-K","speakerRaw":"马卡里俄斯","quoteRaw":"我……想要看到姐姐长大成人的模样。","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-098-lb5-2-olympos.txt:120"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueId":"dlg-lb5-2-K-002","timelineId":"evt-lb5-2-K","speakerRaw":"阿黛勒","quoteRaw":"你真傻。这种事……就算你不说，我也，一直都，有同样的——— ","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-098-lb5-2-olympos.txt:121"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueId":"dlg-lb5-2-L-001","timelineId":"evt-lb5-2-L","speakerRaw":"武藏","quoteRaw":"我希望那两个人———身体健健康康的！大家一起办一场超级开心的派对吧！","sourceRefs":["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-098-lb5-2-olympos.txt:124"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"}
  ]
}
